repository-code: "https://github.com/erenup/dicke-tensor-subrank"
abstract: >-
  For every tuple of at least two positive multiplicities, the ordinary
  asymptotic subrank of the Dicke tensor over the complex numbers and its
  asymptotic subrank under coordinate restrictions both equal the
  exponential of the Shannon entropy of the symbol frequencies, with all
  original tensor factors kept separate. Includes the paper, ten universal
  finite algebraic and combinatorial targets in Lean, and exact supporting
  checks. Files outside paper/ are licensed under MIT; files in paper/,
  including the manuscript source and PDF, are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
keywords:
  - Dicke tensors
  - asymptotic subrank
  - entropy
  - coordinate restrictions
